## Why This Is Asked
Evaluate understanding of low-level allocators, thread-local storage, alignment, and simple memory management without malloc/free.

## Key Concepts
- Thread-local arenas and bump allocation
- Alignment and overflow handling
- Pool reset semantics and fragmentation risk
- Migration to a shared allocator when needed

## Code Example
